    "content" : "I bought this monitor mount from Amazon (<a href=\"http://amzn.com/B000ID7QNI\" class=\"ot-anchor\">http://amzn.com/B000ID7QNI</a>) for $15. I&#39;ve had it on my wish list for a while but since I moved and got a new desk that I could mount it on, I finally got it. So far I like it. It saves the space where it used to sit and I can move it to see much easier. Definitely worth the money.",
